    "teaches": "The forward pass is a continuous flow of one tensor being reshaped: z grows step by step into an image, or an image collapses step by step into Pr(real).",
    "label": "Play forward pass",
    "loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": "blockHover",
    "type": "hover",
    "teaches": "Reading a block's size annotation on demand links the drawn proportions (face = spatial extent, depth = channel count) to the numbers H×W×C."
